Package: uk.551.no2theft.smsflowfix
Name: No2Theft SMS Flow Fix (Test)
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: 551UK
Author: 551UK
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), xyz.cypwn.no2theft16 (>= 1.3.5), uk.551.no2theft.smslocationfix (>= 0.1.1)
Description: Experimental No2Theft SMS flow isolation for iOS 16.
 Defers the unmodified legacy SMS routine to let PIN and email setup finish.
 Preserves two recipient numbers and the existing SMS GPS replacement.
 Only tested as a build, not yet verified on device. Removable.
